.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-billable-metrics-patch - Update billable metric


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 billable-metrics patch  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
PUT and PATCH both accept partial updates. Omitted fields are unchanged.
When attached to a plan, only the name, description and permitted filter changes can be updated. Changes to locked fields return 422. Filter values referenced by product filters cannot be removed.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and billable_metric write permission on the API key.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--aggregation-type\fP=""
	Aggregation method. field_name is required except for count_agg.; one of: count_agg, sum_agg, max_agg, unique_count_agg, weighted_sum_agg, latest_agg

.PP
\fB--code\fP=""
	Code.

.PP
\fB--description\fP=""
	Description.

.PP
\fB--expression\fP=""
	Expression.

.PP
\fB--field-name\fP=""
	Field name.

.PP
\fB--filters\fP=""
	Complete filter definitions. An empty array removes existing filters. Null, malformed filters and non-string values are rejected before any changes are saved.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for patch

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
	Complete JSON request body or @file.json

.PP
\fB--name\fP=""
	Name.

.PP
\fB--recurring\fP=""
	Whether values carry over between billing periods.

.PP
\fB--rounding-function\fP=""
	Rounding applied to aggregated values.; one of: ceil, floor, round,

.PP
\fB--rounding-precision\fP=""
	Rounding precision.

.PP
\fB--weighted-interval\fP=""
	Weighting interval. Required for weighted_sum_agg.; one of: seconds,


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-key\fP=""
	Override the Lago API key

.PP
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	Override the Lago API URL

.PP
\fB--confirm\fP=""
	Confirm a dangerous operation with its resource identifier

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Print mutating requests without sending them

.PP
\fB--insecure\fP[=false]
	Allow insecure HTTP or TLS for self-hosted Lago

.PP
\fB--mode\fP=""
	Environment mode: live or test

.PP
\fB--no-retry\fP[=false]
	Disable automatic retries

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="table"
	Output format: table, json, or yaml

.PP
\fB--profile\fP=""
	Named profile to use

.PP
\fB--query\fP=""
	JMESPath expression applied to the response

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30s
	Total request timeout

.PP
\fB--timing\fP[=false]
	Print request latency breakdown

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Print redacted request and response details


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  lago v2 billable-metrics patch <code> --input @payload.json
  lago v2 billable-metrics patch <code> --input @payload.json --output json  # full resource
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlago-v2-billable-metrics(1)\fP
